.\" Manual page for aero-touchpad
.TH AERO-TOUCHPAD 1 "October 2026" "Aero Linux v1.4.0" "Aero Linux Manual"
.SH NAME
aero-touchpad \- Touchpad gesture and pointer configurator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aero-touchpad
[\fB\-\-gui\fR] [\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aero-touchpad
is a native desktop developer utility designed for the Aero Linux operating system.
Configure touchpad tap-to-click, natural scrolling, and multi-finger gesture recognition.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-g ", " \-\-gui
Launch the application in standalone GTK3 graphical mode (default).
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print program version information and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display brief usage synopsis and available command-line switches.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AERO_DEBUG
When set to 1, enables verbose diagnostic output to standard error.
.SH AUTHORS
Written and engineered by Ronit Gupta (@ronitgupta138) for Aero Linux.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aero (1),
.BR aero-sysinfo (1)
